      "message": "Open Snaky for direct submissions (issue route)\n\nThe Snaky smoke passed on 2026-11-03: run 41548037272, test issue #113, darkhipo's Bound 20 proof\n(darkhipo/snaky-twenty@f6248dc, smoke.SNAKY_FIXTURE), verifier 0f46479. Lean kernel passed (1545 s, peak\n3.9 GB), nanoda passed (989 s, peak 4.4 GB), axiom audit: Race.bound uses only propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound; total\n2762 s. lean.log has no autoImplicit and no error line (the profile builds with autoImplicit = false).\n\nBefore it, the control and five statement mutations (bigospeedrun/verifier-smoke-snaky, proofs by sorry,\nsmoke.SNAKY_MUTATIONS) were all refused, each as planned (Lead, 2026-11-02: a refusal at Comparator's\ncompare step is accepted from lean.log; these runs came before 2263003 named it statement_mismatch):\n- control 41543423936 (#107, c89f809, bound 20): \"Illegal axiom detected: 'sorryAx'\"; the statement matched\n- M1 41544268863 (#108, c89f809, bound 19): \"Challenge and solution theorem statement do not match: 'Race.bound'\"\n- M2 41544953483 (#109, eca2430, one Snaky cell moved): \"Const does not match between challenge and target 'OAI.SnakyPrototype.snaky'\"\n- M3 41545742606 (#110, 73041ba, one symmetry dropped): \"... 'OAI.SnakyPrototype.orient'\"\n- M4 41546502694 (#111, 299e232, freshness removed): \"... 'BigOSpeedrun.Snaky.Bound'\"\n- M5 41547277453 (#112, 9ddfaee, k < N for k + 1 < N): \"... 'OAI.SnakyPrototype.OrdinaryStrategy.LegalRepliesBeforeFinal'\"\n\n- CLOSED is now empty. The issue form offers snaky (issue route only: a PR folder names only dft, 3sum\n  or apsp).\n- README: the problem list, the meaning (whole Maker moves; smaller is better; a fraction is refused) and\n  the range 0 <= n <= 100. docs/targets.md: a Snaky section (copy the statement byte for byte; a changed\n  definition is a statement mismatch). The statement README and docs/execution.md say the route is open.\n- Tests: Snaky is open (the form option, the problem list, a whole bound runs, 19/2 and 101 do not);\n  the smoke tests no longer expect it closed. 234 OK, also with BOS_SPLIT=true.\n\nThe site half (site 71e84034: profile, statement fixture, PROBLEMS, OTHER row form, submit line) must be\non the site's main branch before this commit is pushed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
